WEBVTT

00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:41.907
The reason I jumped out the window

00:00:43.811 --> 00:00:48.680
Was because the deep blue
sky was so clear

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:54.280
I was still uncertain about
the self I couldn't see

00:00:55.322 --> 00:01:01.056
So I plunged out here, barefoot

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:07.935
There are things I can't
explain or do well

00:01:07.935 --> 00:01:13.771
That lie beyond the mirror
that I stare at so intently

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:20.314
So I put my rumpled-up
dream in my pocket

00:01:20.314 --> 00:01:27.421
And make a promise to myself
in the sky, ten years from now

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:33.027
The future I've always
believed in is no mistake

00:01:33.027 --> 00:01:39.366
Because I'm sure I have stronger
feelings than anyone else

00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:43.598
Tenderly

00:04:15.222 --> 00:04:20.159
Dizzying *
The Big Transformation of Her Dreams

00:05:37.004 --> 00:05:38.938
Psychic Spots!

00:06:14.541 --> 00:06:19.069
Memory Left

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:33.078
Charm

00:22:23.509 --> 00:22:27.913
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:22:27.913 --> 00:22:31.384
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:22:31.384 --> 00:22:36.322
With extraordinary effort
and a little miracle

00:22:36.322 --> 00:22:40.782
I get the feeling that it'll be
rosy and shining soon

00:22:42.662 --> 00:22:47.199
My life in Tokyo is so smooth,
don't I look chic?

00:22:47.199 --> 00:22:50.436
I even did research on
the most trendy clothes

00:22:50.436 --> 00:22:55.074
Now clubs recognize me
and just let me in

00:22:55.074 --> 00:22:59.145
My favorites are my mini-skirts

00:22:59.145 --> 00:23:02.815
It's important to bond
with my friends

00:23:02.815 --> 00:23:06.686
So of course I have a cell phone

00:23:06.686 --> 00:23:14.360
I got it by working hard at a job
that I can't talk about

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:18.431
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:23:18.431 --> 00:23:22.101
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:22.101 --> 00:23:24.270
I don't know what I want to do

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:31.608
It seems these facts of
loneliness keep pouring down

00:23:33.946 --> 00:23:38.050
I don't know why I feel so sad,
I can't even cry

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:41.687
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:41.687 --> 00:23:46.559
When I hear "How are you holding up"
in that familiar voice

00:23:46.559 --> 00:23:51.087
It feels like something's tugging
at my heartstrings

00:23:55.368 --> 00:24:20.526
Next Happy Lesson

00:24:20.526 --> 00:24:25.486
Next Happy Lesson
Nice and Warm *
All Alone with Kanna
